  "summary_en": "California Assembly Bill 489 (Chapter 615, 2025), chaptered law prohibiting AI and generative AI systems from using terms, letters or phrases implying healthcare licensure, extending existing licensing-title protections to AI developers and deployers, enforced by health licensing boards, with each use a separate violation.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Licensing-title prohibitions apply to entities developing or deploying AI/GenAI using protected health terms.",
   "AI advertising or functionality implying care is provided by a licensed natural person is prohibited.",
   "Enforcement by the relevant health care licensing boards, including injunctions.",
   "Each use of a prohibited term is a separate violation.",
   "Adds Chapter 15.5 (Sections 4999.8-4999.9) to the Business and Professions Code."
